@participant3 Awesome!

I uninstalled Windows SDK, validated that the build failed as it did before I installed it previously, and then tested your fixes and they worked.

I formatted your patch to be like the other optimization mode tweaks in the build.zig ([`optimize_lua`](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/2b7d793cd6173a7391c858967fdacad1b672103b/build.zig#L62) and [`optimize_ts`](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/2b7d793cd6173a7391c858967fdacad1b672103b/build.zig#L144)).

